{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;<i>Cyberpunk: Shadow of Ethereal City</i>&quot;</strong> is a 2.5D platformer stealth RPG set in the futuristic metropolis of <strong>Ethereal City</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/IMG_1237_20250314-202557_.jpg?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of <strong>HC999</strong>, a former bionic worker designed to recover the special energy known as <i><strong>GhostDrive</strong></i>. To avoid being reclaimed and destroyed by the corporation, HC999 must fight for survival while repairing their own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/image.png?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uniquely blends <strong>stealth mechanics with dice rolls</strong>\u2014when performing actions such as assassinations, hacking, or movement, the outcome is partially influenced by the dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/E.png?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use nanotechnology to enter the souls of others and experience juicy burger patties with spicy crawfish flavored staff meals.<br>(English localization of the game coming soon)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/IMG_1249_20250314-205021_.jpg?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/IMG_1250_20250314-205210_.jpg?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/IMG_1251_20250314-205244_.jpg?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/\u7cbe\u7075-0001.png?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552700?t=1742401956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/d190eac44837375481fbf79cf70e7bc2131c6d50/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742401956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/69cab1316cd3ee623cd86dd939fd5d97aea3724a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742401956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/69cab1316cd3ee623cd86dd939fd5d97aea3724a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742401956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Homicide, self-inflicted wounds, medical substance abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;<i>Cyberpunk: Shadow of Ethereal City</i>&quot;</strong> is a 2.5D platformer stealth RPG set in the futuristic metropolis of <strong>Ethereal City</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/IMG_1237_20250314-202557_.jpg?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of <strong>HC999</strong>, a former bionic worker designed to recover the special energy known as <i><strong>GhostDrive</strong></i>. To avoid being reclaimed and destroyed by the corporation, HC999 must fight for survival while repairing their own body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/image.png?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uniquely blends <strong>stealth mechanics with dice rolls</strong>\u2014when performing actions such as assassinations, hacking, or movement, the outcome is partially influenced by the dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552700/extras/E.png?t=1742401956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use nanotechnology to enter the souls of others and experience juicy burger patties with spicy crawfish flavored staff meals.<br>(English localization of